{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Display or set the hostname and FQDN, persist it in /etc/hostname and /etc/hosts, and verify.","label":"hostname","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/hit_url","label":"Hit URL","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/hit_url"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/hosts","label":"hosts","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/hosts"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>hostname<\/code> displays the current hostname.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>hostname<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-f<\/code> displays the FQDN.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>hostname -f<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Set hostname<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>hostname &lt;name&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThis is not saved in <code class='inline'>\/etc\/hostname<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTo persist:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: this replaces <code class='inline'>\/etc\/hostname<\/code> and edits <code class='inline'>\/etc\/hosts<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>echo &lt;hostname&gt; &gt; \/etc\/hostname\nhostname -F \/etc\/hostname<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEdit <code class='inline'>\/etc\/hosts<\/code>:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>vi \/etc\/hosts<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAppend:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Global IP&gt; [FQDN] &lt;hostname&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Verify<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>hostname\nhostname -f<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>hostname<\/code> should show only the hostname. <code class='inline'>hostname -f<\/code> should show the FQDN.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>SSH name<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFor updating the SSH name, delete the <code class='inline'>known_hosts<\/code> entry.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/hostname\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/hostname\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/hit_url' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/hit_url' data-title='Hit URL' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Hit URL<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/hosts' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/hosts' data-title='hosts' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>hosts<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/nix.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>*Nix<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}